{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本日、ANNに出演させていただきます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/11/09/8561361/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーは\nきいちゃん、ひめたん、未央奈、中田"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そう！サンエト風です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"蘭世も一緒に出たかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/11/09/8561361/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1部に出演させていただくのは初めて！！\n嬉しい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/11/09/8561361/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさん是非メール送ってね～！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/11/09/8561361/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は16thシングル発売日です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/11/09/8561361/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田推しは\nType-B　と　Type-D\nですね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/11/09/8561361/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Type-B には\nアンダー楽曲の\n『ブランコ』が収録されてます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"特典映像は\n『ブランコ』のMVと\n『アンダー ドキュメンタリー〜つま先の向こうに〜』というアンダーにフォーカスを当てたものが入ってます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しかも！\nジャケ写、裏面に中田いますよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Type-Dには\n『君に贈る花がない』が収録されてます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もちろんMVも！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どっちもよろしく～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/11/09/8561361/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、今回のスペイベは\n『乃木坂メンバーとゲーム！会。』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゲーム会って初めて？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何やるか楽しみ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/11/09/8561361/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"てことで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"16thシングルもよろしくお願いします"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/11/09/8561361/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"発売日ってなると"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ななみんの卒業が\n近づいてくる感じがする"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"というか、実感する"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寂しい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}